# The unanchored data/ rule above also matches the src/fmri2img/data/ *package*,
# which silently blocked new library modules there (existing ones predate the
# rule). Un-ignore the package explicitly. Anchoring data/ to /data/ instead
!src/fmri2img/data/
!src/fmri2img/data/*.py
docs/PBT/
docs/Thesis/

